&lt;p class=&#34;wp-block-paragraph&#34;&gt;Amazon, meanwhile, has a more direct connection to the spending itself. Its shopping app lets consumers browse millions of products, compare prices, read reviews, receive deal notifications and track deliveries. Those features make it easier to turn a few minutes of browsing on a smartphone into an actual purchase. Amazon has continued &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-shopping-app&#34;&gt;adding&lt;/a&gt; shopping and discovery tools to its app, including AI-powered shopping guides and visual product discovery.&lt;/p&gt;



