&lt;h2 class=&#34;wp-block-heading&#34;&gt;Payment Companies Want a Cut&lt;/h2&gt;



&lt;p class=&#34;wp-block-paragraph&#34;&gt;The mobile shopping opportunity extends beyond retailers and device makers. &lt;strong&gt;PayPal Holdings, Inc.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a data-ticker=&#34;PYPL&#34; data-exchange=&#34;NASDAQ&#34; href=&#34;https://www.benzinga.com/quote/PYPL&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34;ticker-link&#34;&gt;(NASDAQ:PYPL)&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Shopify Inc.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a data-ticker=&#34;SHOP&#34; data-exchange=&#34;NASDAQ&#34; href=&#34;https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SHOP&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; class=&#34;ticker-link&#34;&gt;(NASDAQ:SHOP)&lt;/a&gt; provide infrastructure that helps merchants convert mobile browsing into completed transactions.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p class=&#34;wp-block-paragraph&#34;&gt;PayPal&amp;#8217;s checkout offering gives merchants access to multiple payment options, including Venmo and Pay Later. That matters during the holiday rush, when a complicated payment process can give shoppers another reason to abandon their carts. PayPal&amp;#8217;s &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.paypal.com/us/business/accept-payments/checkout&#34;&gt;checkout&lt;/a&gt; platform is designed to simplify that final step.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p class=&#34;wp-block-paragraph&#34;&gt;Shopify&amp;#8217;s Shop Pay tackles the same challenge through saved payment and shipping details. The company says its accelerated checkout can deliver conversion rates up to 50% higher than standard checkout. Its &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shopify.com/checkout&#34;&gt;checkout&lt;/a&gt; platform also supports one-tap payments across devices.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;h2 class=&#34;wp-block-heading&#34;&gt;Investment Takeaway&lt;/h2&gt;



&lt;p class=&#34;wp-block-paragraph&#34;&gt;Investors should watch whether rising mobile spending translates into stronger Amazon sales, higher merchant conversion rates and greater payment volumes for PayPal and Shopify.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p class=&#34;wp-block-paragraph&#34;&gt;The $4.4 billion forecast signals an opportunity, but execution will determine who captures the most value.&lt;/p&gt;



